{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>DocLens – OCR 是一款專為律師、記者及翻譯人員而設的專業文字辨識工具，可從截圖或相片中精確抽取指定條款、日期或引文，需 iOS 17.0 或以上版本。原價 US $9.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>精準框選文字提取</h2>\n<p>使用 Skia 框選功能，在截圖或相片上拖曳精確範圍，只辨識所需區域；將同一框選套用到其餘頁面，即可批次處理最多 10 頁文件。內建 Apple 翻譯支援離線中英文互譯，全程不經伺服器。無帳號、無遙測、無雲端上傳，資料只留在 iOS 沙盒內，離線翻譯需 iOS 17.4 或以上。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-444-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-445-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-446-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-447-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-448-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-449-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：DocLens – OCR</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T15:59:32.337706+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":302,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}